WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.268 line:0%
[closing door echoing]

00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:04.537 line:0%
(man)
[yelling indistinctly]

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:11.077 align:start position:0%
Hey, man.

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:13.179 align:start position:0%
You gotta let me
out of here.

00:00:13.212 --> 00:00:14.547 align:start size:31% position:69%
Oh, okay.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:15.782
[keys jangling]

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:20.787
[dramatic music]

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:27.527
♪ ♪

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.469 align:start position:0%
You tricked me.

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:39.572 align:end position:100%
I can honestly say
I wasn't trying to trick you.

00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:43.376 align:start position:0%
You weren't?

00:00:43.409 --> 00:00:45.244 align:end size:94% position:94%
All I said was, "You gotta
let me out of here."

00:00:45.277 --> 00:00:47.413 align:start size:56% position:44%
There's no trick.

00:00:47.446 --> 00:00:49.482 align:start position:0%
So I do have to let you
out of here?

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.285 align:start size:16% position:84%
Yes?

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:54.387 align:start position:0%
Okay.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:57.390
[dramatic music]

00:00:57.423 --> 00:01:02.428
♪ ♪

00:01:02.461 --> 00:01:03.429 align:start position:0%
Bon voyage.

00:01:03.462 --> 00:01:05.532
♪ ♪

00:01:10.369 --> 00:01:11.604 align:end position:100%
Order's to let him go,
I don't know why

00:01:11.637 --> 00:01:12.806
he's in here in the first place.
I don't know.

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:24.451 align:start position:0%
[sucks in air]
[whispering] Sorry.

00:01:26.318 --> 00:01:27.753 align:start position:0%
Boy, you really
got me in trouble.

00:01:27.786 --> 00:01:29.255 align:start size:22% position:78%
Sorry.

00:01:29.288 --> 00:01:30.423 align:start position:0%
Yeah, you must think
I'm stupid.

00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:34.227 align:start position:0%
Well, I'm not stupid.
I'm smart, so--

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.696
You know how you could prove
that you're really smart?

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.598 align:start position:0%
Oh, yeah, let me guess.

00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:40.299 align:start position:0%
You want me to let you
out of here again.

00:01:40.332 --> 00:01:41.500
- Well.
- You know what?

00:01:41.533 --> 00:01:44.637 align:start position:0%
You think that you can trick me
into letting you out again.

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:49.208 align:start position:0%
Well, you can't.
'Cause this is my choice.

00:01:49.241 --> 00:01:51.544
[dramatic music]

00:01:51.577 --> 00:01:52.712
- Get the heck out of here.
- All right.

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:53.546 align:start position:0%
All right?

00:01:55.214 --> 00:01:56.782 align:start size:63% position:38%
Reverse psychology.

00:01:56.815 --> 00:02:00.587
♪ ♪

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:08.661 align:end size:94% position:94%
(guard)
Sorry about that, guys.
That was me, guys, my bad.

00:02:08.694 --> 00:02:10.563 align:start size:25% position:75%
My bad.

00:02:18.604 --> 00:02:20.706 align:end position:100%
[laughs]
Real nice.

00:02:20.739 --> 00:02:22.508
Now they said they're gonna
dock my pay, and if I let you

00:02:22.541 --> 00:02:24.510 align:end position:100%
out of here again,
I'm gonna be severely punished.

00:02:24.543 --> 00:02:26.946 align:end position:100%
I mean,
what are you gonna do?

00:02:26.979 --> 00:02:29.916 align:start position:0%
I'm actually surprised
they haven't already

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:31.484 size:84% position:42%
thrown you in here with me.

00:02:31.517 --> 00:02:33.352 align:start size:44% position:56%
No, prison is
for bad guys.

00:02:33.385 --> 00:02:36.222 align:end position:100%
You're a bad guy,
and I'm a good guy.

00:02:36.255 --> 00:02:38.758 align:start position:0%
Yeah, but you could see how,
from my perspective,

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:41.194 align:start position:0%
I'm a good guy.

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:42.695 align:start size:78% position:22%
Wait, you're a good guy?

00:02:42.728 --> 00:02:45.565
[dramatic music]

00:02:48.834 --> 00:02:52.539 align:start position:0%
It doesn't seem like you
understand what your job is.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:58.377 align:end position:100%
Oh, oh, okay.
I see what you're doing.

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.846 align:end position:100%
You're trying to manipulate me
with reverse psychology.

00:03:00.879 --> 00:03:02.682
- Well, it's not gonna work.
- No.

00:03:05.484 --> 00:03:06.752
[sad music]

00:03:06.785 --> 00:03:08.354 align:start position:0%
It's not even worth going
out there again.

00:03:08.387 --> 00:03:13.226 size:84% position:42%
Look, they just gon' get me
and bring me back in here,

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:15.828 size:78% position:39%
just like they always do.

00:03:15.861 --> 00:03:17.630
♪ ♪

00:03:17.663 --> 00:03:18.965 align:start position:0%
Unless...

00:03:18.998 --> 00:03:20.366 align:start size:19% position:81%
What?

00:03:20.399 --> 00:03:23.402 align:start position:0%
No, I'm--
forget it, I don't want

00:03:23.435 --> 00:03:25.004 align:start position:0%
to take advantage
of you anymore.

00:03:25.037 --> 00:03:28.774
Look, hey, no, no, listen.
I'm not gonna fall for it,

00:03:28.807 --> 00:03:33.012 align:end position:100%
whatever it is.
You may as well just tell me.

00:03:33.045 --> 00:03:36.849 align:start position:0%
I was just gonna say that,
like, if you were to help me...

00:03:36.882 --> 00:03:38.017 align:start size:25% position:75%
Uh-huh.

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:38.985 align:start position:0%
get past the guards...

00:03:39.018 --> 00:03:40.386 align:start size:38% position:63%
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:40.419 --> 00:03:41.687 size:78% position:39%
and get all the way out--

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:42.688 align:start size:19% position:81%
Okay.

00:03:42.721 --> 00:03:45.591 align:start position:0%
I really--
no, I have to tell you.

00:03:45.624 --> 00:03:49.295 align:start position:0%
You need to think
about this long and hard.

00:03:49.328 --> 00:03:51.597 align:start position:0%
Weigh your options
and consider

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:53.966 align:start position:0%
the ramifications
of those options.

00:03:53.999 --> 00:03:55.001 align:start size:56% position:44%
Like heck I will.

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:56.636
[dramatic music]

00:03:56.669 --> 00:03:57.770
- Let's go.
- All right.

00:03:57.803 --> 00:03:59.372
- I'm busting you outta here!
- Shh.

00:03:59.405 --> 00:04:00.840 align:start position:0%
Don't--don't yell, man.

00:04:00.873 --> 00:04:02.308 align:start position:0%
You might as well
ring the alarm.

00:04:02.341 --> 00:04:03.809
- Good idea, yeah.
- No--

00:04:03.842 --> 00:04:05.411
[alarm blaring]

00:04:05.444 --> 00:04:06.979 align:start position:0%
Look, look, he--ah!
He's--

00:04:07.012 --> 00:04:09.615
- Oh, hi, Tom.
- It was--

00:04:09.648 --> 00:04:10.750 align:end position:100%
Good to see you guys.
Yeah.

00:04:10.783 --> 00:04:12.919 align:start size:53% position:47%
Oh, boy, I did it
again, didn't I?

00:04:15.087 --> 00:04:16.689 align:start position:0% line:0%
It's actually very ironic,
'cause when I was

00:04:16.722 --> 00:04:18.591 align:start position:0% line:0%
a prison guard--
when I was a prison guard,

00:04:18.624 --> 00:04:19.392 align:start position:0% line:0%
I wasn't allowed
to talk to the prisoners.

00:04:19.425 --> 00:04:20.593 align:start position:0%
That was the thing,
they said to me,

00:04:20.626 --> 00:04:22.695 align:start position:0%
"If you talk to those prisoners,
you're gonna get in trouble.

00:04:22.728 --> 00:04:24.864
You're gonna get in trouble."
Now that I'm in here with you,

00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:27.366
I can talk as much as I want.
Just babble on, and babble on,

00:04:27.399 --> 00:04:28.768 align:start position:0%
and babble on, we can talk about
anything you want. Any--any--

